  "derivation": "The floating island obeys C d(mu_2)/dt=-I_2. In the long counting-time limit its bounded charge cannot contribute variance per time, giving delta I_a=delta I_a^0-G_a2 delta I_2^0/G_22. The specified macroscopic linear Langevin limit consistently evaluates bare scattering noise at the self-consistent mean potential.",
